      "update_id": "billing-subscriptions-bacs-debit::bacs-subscription-path-scope",
      "target_path": "wiki/concepts/stripe-bacs-direct-debit.md",
      "old_text": "Bacs subscriptions use Checkout (`payment_method_types: ['bacs_debit']`, `mode='subscription'`). No custom Elements path.",
      "new_text": "The 2026-05-13 and 2026-11-07 Bacs subscription guide documents a Checkout path with `mode='subscription'` and at least one recurring Price. Its May Node.js examples explicitly select `bacs_debit`; November curl examples omit that field and direct Dashboard payment-method configuration. This guide alone does not resolve other subscription UI paths or account eligibility.",
      "reason": "Qualify Checkout as this guide's path and date the Node-only example without treating curl omission as deprecation.",
